            <generalComment xml:lang="en">This module refers to the European recycling paper production based on confidential primary data from 9 common recycling paper (weighted average) on behalf of a project funded by the Swiss Federal Office for the Environment FOEN:  The total annual production is 1'242'000 metric tons which represents about 10.4% of the annual production of the graphical recycling papers (without newspaper) used in the EU. 

